wf-hull-bond-examine-unbonded = It will bond to the first hull it is bolted to.
wf-hull-bond-examine-here = It is bonded to the hull of [color=cyan]{ $ship }[/color] and can only be bolted down aboard it.
wf-hull-bond-examine-away = It is bonded to the hull of [color=cyan]{ $ship }[/color] and [color=red]will not bolt down here[/color].
wf-hull-bond-examine-board = It is bonded to the hull of [color=cyan]{ $ship }[/color]. What it builds only bolts down there, and it will not flatpack.
wf-hull-bond-anchor-fail = It is bonded to the hull of { $ship } and will not bolt down here.
wf-hull-bond-unknown-ship = another ship
